      "quotes": [
        "Table 3 presents the ablation results of the proposed components on the IEMOCAP benchmark. Based on the MemoCMT baseline (81.05% WA and 81.33% UA), adding the Euclidean Multimodal Fusion Module (EuclFusion) improves the performance to 81.95% WA and 82.38% UA.",
        "This corresponds to an improvement of 0.90% in WA and 1.05% in UA, demonstrating that enhanced cross-modal interaction can effectively improve emotion representation learning.",
        "When the Hyperbolic Geometric Core Routing (HypGeoRoute) module is further incorporated, the full GeoMER model achieves the best performance with 83.54% WA and 83.35% UA.",
        "Compared with the MemoCMT baseline, the proposed method improves WA by 2.49% and UA by 2.02%.",
        "Table 3: Ablation study of different components on IEMOCAP (4-class). WA, UA, and Macro-F1 denote weighted accuracy, unweighted accuracy, and macro-averaged F1-score, respectively."
      ],
      "quoteOnlyResolved": true,
